            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>We help New Zealand businesses find reliable workwear, safety footwear, and uniforms—without the hassle of trial and error</p><p><strong>Footwear & Apparel NZ Ltd  - </strong>established for over 25 years is a privately owned New Zealand business operated by Stuart and Rebecca Williams. </p><p><strong>Stu</strong> brings over 20 years of experience in safety footwear and PPE across both retail and wholesale. As a Health & Safety professional, he’s known for giving practical, straight-up advice and helping customers get it right the first time—so you’re not wasting money replacing gear that doesn’t last.</p><p><strong>Rebecca</strong> keeps everything running smoothly behind the scenes. With a background in hospitality and retail, she’s focused on delivering a seamless and positive experience for every customer.</p><p></p><p></p>",
